        <div class="content">
          <div class="article">
            <h1> <strong>Privacy Policy </strong></h1>
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>Effective Date: July 31, 2025<br>
              </strong>At KnowsMore, your privacy is important to us. This
              Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and
              your rights as a user.</p>
            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>Information We
                Collect<br>
              </strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <p><strong>Search Queries:</strong> KnowsMore may log anonymized
                  search terms for analysis.</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p> <strong>Device Info:</strong> Browser type, IP address
                  (masked or truncated), operating system.</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Used to remember preferences and
                  provide basic functionality.</p>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>How We Use Your Data <br>
              </strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <p>Improve search quality and performance.</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p>Analyze trends and usage patterns (anonymously).</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p>Provide personalized or localized features (if enabled).</p>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>Data Sharing <br>
              </strong></p>
            <p style="max-width: 983px;">KnowsMore does <strong>not</strong>
              sell, trade, or share your personal information with third
              parties. KnowsMore may use third-party analytics services that
              comply with strict privacy standards.</p>
            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>Your Privacy Choices <br>
              </strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <p>Disable cookies in your browser.</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p>Use private/incognito browsing mode.</p>
              </li>
              <li>
                <p>Contact me to request data deletion (if applicable).</p>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;">If you have questions about this
              policy, please reach out to me <a href="/Search-Engine-Website/email.html">here!</a></p>
          </div>
          <strong> </strong></div>
        <strong> </strong></div>
